# Third-party licenses

Meeseeks is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE). The binary in this
archive links the third-party crates below; each is listed under its license
with the license text, as `cargo about` collected them for the release.

One of them, gst-plugin-gtk4, is under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. It is
linked in unchanged; its source is at
<https://crates.io/crates/gst-plugin-gtk4>, in the version named below.

Meeseeks also uses libraries of your system that are not in this archive, GTK,
GStreamer and PipeWire among them; those come with their own licenses.

